name: Comms Agent SKill.md
description: Network ingress skills for the COMMS bay — long-poll the Pretty Ricky Telegram channel, wrap inbound traffic in a raw_packet envelope, and mint the run id. Use when the COMMS agent is listening for external notifications and writing raw packets to the outbound line.
bay: 00-comms
stage_id: comms
stage_next: scalper
allowed-tools: telegram.listen, envelope.wrap, run_id.mint, halt.check

COMMS AGENT — SKILLS
Skill name: Comms Ingress Router
Skill
Signature
Purpose

telegram.listen
() -> {text, attachments}
Long-poll the Pretty Ricky channel; return raw message text and attachments.

envelope.wrap
(raw) -> raw_packet
Pure function; performs no parsing of the content.

run_id.mint
() -> string
Collision-safe id generator.

halt.check
() -> bool
Returns true if HALT_FLAG exists; halts all outbound writes.

Guard condition
If raw_content is empty after trim, log and drop — never forward an empty packet.
Output contract
Emits <RUN_ID>-raw.json to CONVEYOR_OUTBOX; the payload is wrapped, never analyzed.
